        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank"> [integer</a> use_static_mesh ]</td>
        <td>[ FALSE ]</td>
        <td>Specifies whether the test should use the static or dynamic nav mesh. In the static case, all dynamic obstacles are ignored.</td>
